		(uuid "ad0c053f-3ab7-4863-88b3-3df8ee8276d9")
	)
	(text "JP3: centre -> R9. Blob to pin 3 = stage 2 (x121); move it to pin 1 = stage 1 only (x11) if stage 2 clips. C6 is DNP: fit it instead of bridging JP2 to AC-couple TX."
